{"seq":1,"slug":"controversies","title":"争议","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/marcus-aurelius/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"persecution-of-christians","title":"对基督徒的迫害","url":"/c/people/marcus-aurelius/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies/persecution-of-christians","wordCount":1750,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-succession-of-commodus","title":"康茂德的继承","url":"/c/people/marcus-aurelius/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies/the-succession-of-commodus","wordCount":1532,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 争议\n\n本章客观地呈现围绕马可·奥勒留的主要争议。他统治时期对基督徒的迫害，以及打破选贤传统、传位昏庸的康茂德，是评价这位贤君时不可回避的争议。两篇文档，分别呈现对基督徒的迫害，以及康茂德的继承，力求客观而全面。\n"}